DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       These  functions  calculate  the  complex arc hyperbolic sine of _z.  If
       _y _= _c_a_s_i_n_h_(_z_), then _z _= _c_s_i_n_h_(_y_).  The imaginary part of _y is chosen in
       the interval [-pi/2,pi/2].

       One has:

           casinh(z) = clog(z + csqrt(z * z + 1))

